00:02:42.243 --> 00:02:52.683
<v Slow>駅の近くの商店街に、大きくてきれいな七夕の飾りが、100本ぐらい並びます。

00:02:53.484 --> 00:03:00.156
<v Host>On the shopping street near the station, about a hundred big, beautiful decorations are lined up.

00:03:00.756 --> 00:03:02.939
