00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:05.644
<v Host>A decoration, an ornament.

00:03:06.243 --> 00:03:14.716
<v Slow>飾りには、色とりどりの紙や、人気のキャラクターが使われています。

00:03:15.515 --> 00:03:19.883
<v Host>The decorations use colorful paper and popular characters.

00:03:20.484 --> 00:03:22.716
