00:03:23.116 --> 00:03:26.500
<v Host>Popularity; being popular, well-liked.

00:03:27.099 --> 00:03:35.187
<v Slow>お祭りは、7月3日から5日までの、3日間開かれます。

00:03:35.987 --> 00:03:40.644
<v Host>The festival is held for three days, from July third to the fifth.

00:03:41.243 --> 00:03:43.451
